  "about": "Adding and taking away within 20 by hopping along a number line: start on the dot, jump right to add, jump back to take away, and count the jumps to find a missing part. The number line is one of the strategies NC.1.OA.6 names for adding and subtracting within 20, and the \"how many jumps\" cards are NC.1.OA.4 (finding an unknown addend by counting on).",
